  },
  "StockRole": "Brawler",
  "YangsThoughts": "A Draconis Combine developed Omni mech, the Sunder is based on reverse engineered Loki and Thor Omnimechs. A 360-rated XL Engine allows the omnimech to carry 15 DHS along with 16.5 tons of armor and 36 tons of weapons. The Sunder SD1-O is armed with an AC/20 and a pair of Large Lasers. 2 Medium Lasers and a trio of SRM-4’s act as secondary weapons. ",
